Using templates in FastAPI
- Templates allow us to serve up HTML pages to our users while still maintaining our json endpoints for the the backend api.
- So in this case we will setup Jinja2 templates, pass data to templates, use Jinja2 syntax for foor loops and conditionals, implement
template inheritence with a layout.html. Add bootstrap for styling and setup static files for our css and images

Template inheritence
Gives the capability to create a parent template with the common structure nd then the child templates just fill in the parts that are different 
in this case we will be using the layout.html file as our parent template file